B.IR=new A.dJ("/real-numbers-cost","8. Ger\xe7ek rakamlar #2: token hesab\u0131 ve model tuza\u011f\u0131","BEAT  [14:00 - 16:30] Ger\xe7ek Rakamlar #2: token hesab\u0131 ve 2026 model k\u0131s\u0131tlamas\u0131 tuza\u011f\u0131.\nSAY   \"\u0130kinci rakam c\xfczdan\u0131m\u0131zla ilgili. Token, modelin okudu\u011fu ve \xfcretti\u011fi metin par\xe7as\u0131; faturay\u0131 o belirliyor. Biz her t\u0131klamada modele gitmiyoruz. Sadece tepsi haz\u0131r olup Servis Et'e bas\u0131l\u0131nca tek bir \xe7a\u011fr\u0131 yap\u0131yoruz. Bu \xe7a\u011fr\u0131 yakla\u015f\u0131k 150 token okuyor, 120 token yaz\u0131yor: sipari\u015f ba\u015f\u0131na yakla\u015f\u0131k 270 token. Hesaplad\u0131k: 1.000 sipari\u015f 5 sentten az tutuyor. Bir de tuzak var: yeni a\xe7\u0131lan Google Cloud projelerinde eski gemini-2.5-flash modelleri k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131. Eski model ad\u0131n\u0131 yazarsan\u0131z yeni hesap hata al\u0131r. O y\xfczden kodda varsay\u0131lan model gemini-3.5-flash-lite.\"\nHOLD  Sa\u011fdaki kodda defaultValue: 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite' sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6ster. 270 token [YAKLA\u015eIK HESAP] (~150 + ~120), \xf6l\xe7\xfcm diye s\xf6yleme. 1.000 sipari\u015f = 0,0468 dolar da [HESAP] (docs/benchmark-report-2026-10-24.md, gemini-3.5-flash-lite liste fiyat\u0131). [Olgu (cafe_judge_service.dart:20-25 ve ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models): at\xf6lyede kurulum gerekmesin diye package:http ile REST generateContent; production'da firebase_ai + App Check].\nNEWS  [Bu hafta, yaln\u0131z s\xf6zl\xfc] \"Bu hafta Gemini 4 Hydrogen genel kullan\u0131ma a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131: 1 milyon token ba\u011flam, 1 milyon girdi token'\u0131 1,50 dolar, 1 milyon \xe7\u0131kt\u0131 token'\u0131 7,50 dolar. Biz at\xf6lyede gemini-3.5-flash-lite'ta kal\u0131yoruz. Yeni model \xe7\u0131kt\u0131 diye canl\u0131 sistemi ayn\u0131 g\xfcn de\u011fi\u015ftirmiyoruz, \xf6nce rakamlar\u0131 \xf6l\xe7\xfcyoruz.\" [Olgu (aistudio.google.com/docs/changelog, 12 Kas\u0131m 2026 ve aistudio.google.com/docs/pricing): gemini-4-hydrogen genel kullan\u0131mda, 1M ba\u011flam, 1M token ba\u015f\u0131na $1.50 girdi / $7.50 \xe7\u0131kt\u0131].\nNEXT  \"Peki 300 ki\u015fi ayn\u0131 anda bu butona basarsa ne olur? \xdc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc rakama ge\xe7elim.\"",!1,!1,1,B.aU,null,B.aR,B.aK,B.aE,B.aH,B.aC,B.aL,!0,B.aS,B.aI,B.aT)
B.SP=new A.Oi(B.IR,null)
B.IO=new A.dJ("/room-quota-trap","9. Ger\xe7ek rakamlar #3: 300 ki\u015filik salonda kota tuza\u011f\u0131",'BEAT  [16:30 - 18:30] Ger\xe7ek Rakamlar #3: 300 ki\u015filik salonda HTTP 429 tuza\u011f\u0131 ve \xe7\xf6z\xfcm\xfcm\xfcz.\nSAY   "Bir at\xf6lyeyi bat\u0131ran klasik hata \u015fu: konu\u015fmac\u0131 kendi API anahtar\u0131n\u0131 b\xfct\xfcn salonla payla\u015f\u0131r. \xdccretsiz katmanda h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 anahtar ba\u015f\u0131na de\u011fil, Google Cloud projesi ba\u015f\u0131na. Dakikada 5 ile 15 istek kadar. 300 ki\u015fi tek projeye y\xfcklenirse birka\xe7 saniyede HTTP 429 al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z, yani \'kotan\u0131z doldu\' hatas\u0131. Sanal laboratuvarlar da etkinlik ba\u015f\u0131na 100 ki\u015fiyle s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131. Biz bunu d\xf6rt katmanla a\u015f\u0131yoruz. Bir: herkes kendi \xfccretsiz AI Studio anahtar\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131yor. \u0130ki: sipari\u015f ba\u015f\u0131na tek istek at\u0131yoruz. \xdc\xe7: AI Studio Starter Tier ile Cloud Run\'a yay\u0131nl\u0131yoruz. D\xf6rt: a\u011f giderse uygulama \xe7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 yede\u011fe, yani haz\u0131r cevaplara d\xfc\u015f\xfcyor."\nHOLD  \xd6nce soldaki k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 "3 saniyede 429" kutusunu, sonra sa\u011fdaki 4 katman\u0131 g\xf6ster. "3 saniye" bir [HESAP] (dakikada 15 istek s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131na 300 ki\u015fi), salonda \xf6l\xe7\xfclmedi. [Olgu (ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/rate-limits): \xfccretsiz katman = GCP projesi ba\u015f\u0131na 5-15 RPM; GEAR laboratuvarlar\u0131 100 e\u015fzamanl\u0131 VM ile s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131].\nNEXT  "Peki ayn\u0131 kodu yeniden derlemeden Berlin, Gaziantep, Adana ve \u0130stanbul\'a nas\u0131l uyarl\u0131yoruz?"',!1,!1,1,B.aU,null,B.aR,B.aK,B.aE,B.aH,B.aC,B.aL,!0,B.aS,B.aI,B.aT)
