B.IS=new A.dJ("/generate-vs-decide","Yedek: \xfcretmek mi, karar vermek mi? CafeReview ve Decisions API","BEAT  [BACKUP \xb7 Konya, 60 sn] Slayt 11'den Stage Navigator ile gelinir. Ayn\u0131 j\xfcri, iki API: \xfcretmek mi, karar vermek mi?\nSAY   \"Bizim j\xfcri iki i\u015f yap\u0131yor. Birincisi komik yorumu yazmak: bu \xfcretim i\u015fi, metin laz\u0131m. \u0130kincisi tatl\u0131 m\u0131 tuzlu mu demek: bu bir karar, cevab\u0131 \xfc\xe7 se\xe7enekten biri. Bug\xfcn ikisini tek generateContent \xe7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131nda yap\u0131yoruz ve karar\u0131 JSON'dan okuyoruz. Google'\u0131n Decisions API'si karar\u0131 ayr\u0131 soruyor: metin \xfcretmiyor, her se\xe7enek i\xe7in olas\u0131l\u0131k d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcyor, \xe7\u0131kt\u0131 token\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131r. Dart SDK's\u0131 yok, package:http ile REST \xe7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 yeterli. Oyuna ba\u011flamad\u0131m, \xe7\xfcnk\xfc tuz kontrol\xfcn\xfc zaten Dart yap\u0131yor. Kodla yazamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z kararlarda deneyin.\"\nHOLD  \xd6nce soldaki 'tasteVerdict' sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131, sonra sa\u011fdaki 'type': 'choice' sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6ster. Gecikme ve fiyat rakam\u0131 s\xf6yleme. [Fact (cafe_judge_service.dart:203, 220-241): generateContent + responseSchema; cafe_judge_service.dart:369-379: _verdictMatchesPranks]. [Fact (aistudio.google.com/docs/decisions-api, 13 Nov 2026): gemini-decision-1; noul, choice, score; 1 to 1,000 questions per request; output tokens always 0, only input tokens billed; SDK tabs Python and JavaScript (3.2+) and REST; v1beta only].\nNEXT  \"Stage Navigator ile ak\u0131\u015fa d\xf6n: Konya ak\u0131\u015f\u0131nda s\u0131radaki ad\u0131m canl\u0131 demo.\"",!1,!1,1,B.aU,null,B.aR,B.aK,B.aE,B.aH,B.aC,B.aL,!0,B.aS,B.aI,B.aT)
